 hope and sets off on a wild and wacky adventure to find the truth and to reunite his family."},"tags":[{"name":"Fugitive","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Real Robot","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Military","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Space","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Family Life","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"War","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Primarily Adult Cast","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Robots","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Artificial Intelligence","rank":46,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Estranged Family","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Dystopian","rank":40,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Z.O.E Dolores, i","english":"Z.O.E Dolores, i","native":"Z.O.E Dolores,i","romaji":"Z.O.E Dolores,i","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"终极地带ZOE"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"狂野禁区"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Zone of the Enders: Dolores, I"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"ゾーン オブ エンダーズ ドロレス・アイ"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}